          <h1 id="hero-title">We simplify, modernize, and performance-optimize the software people build on.</h1>
          <p class="hero-description">
            ModePot is an open-source workshop for modernizing software foundations—and inventing
            what comes next. AI-native and agent-friendly where they add real value.
          </p>
          <a class="text-link" href="#projects">
            Explore the work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
          </a>
          <div class="creator-signature" aria-label="Created by Tugrul Guner">
            <span>Created by <strong>Tugrul Guner</strong></span>
            <div class="creator-links" aria-label="Tugrul Guner on social media">
              <a class="ph-no-autocapture" href="https://github.com/tugrulguner" data-posthog-event="modepot_creator_social_clicked" data-posthog-platform="github" data-posthog-surface="modepot_hero">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
              <a class="ph-no-autocapture" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/tugrulguner/" data-posthog-event="modepot_creator_social_clicked" data-posthog-platform="linkedin" data-posthog-surface="modepot_hero">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
              <a class="ph-no-autocapture" href="https://x.com/Tugrul_Guner" data-posthog-event="modepot_creator_social_clicked" data-posthog-platform="x" data-posthog-surface="modepot_hero">X <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <figure class="modernization-visual" aria-labelledby="modernization-visual-description">
          <div class="modernization-stage" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="input-zone">
              <p class="visual-heading"><span>SOFTWARE IN</span><small>existing systems and hard constraints</small></p>
              <div class="concept-rack input-rack">
                <p><small>EXISTING SOFTWARE</small><b>Frameworks + packages</b></p>
                <p><small>ACCUMULATED FRICTION</small><b>Complexity + bottlenecks</b></p>
                <p><small>OUTDATED ASSUMPTIONS</small><b>Runtimes + patterns</b></p>
                <p><small>LEGACY WORKFLOWS</small><b>Human-only tooling</b></p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="brand-flask">
              <div class="flask-halo"></div>
              <svg class="brand-flask-svg" viewBox="0 0 128 128" aria-hidden="true">
                <defs>
                  <linearGradient id="modepot-liquid" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
                    <stop offset="0" stop-color="#66d9ff" stop-opacity=".28" />
                    <stop offset=".55" stop-color="#2cbda3" stop-opacity=".2" />
                    <stop offset="1" stop-color="#f2b84b" stop-opacity=".3" />
                  </linearGradient>
                  <filter id="modepot-glow" x="-40%" y="-40%" width="180%" height="180%">
                    <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="1.8" result="blur" />
                    <feMerge><feMergeNode in="blur" /><feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic" /></feMerge>
                  </filter>
                  <clipPath id="modepot-chamber">
                    <path d="M48 54C34 64 27 78 27 93c0 16 12 24 37 24s37-8 37-24c0-15-7-29-21-39-4-3-6-7-6-12H54c0 5-2 9-6 12Z" />
                  </clipPath>
                </defs>
                <g clip-path="url(#modepot-chamber)">
                  <path class="flask-liquid" d="M18 82c15-8 28 6 44-1 19-8 31 7 50-2v45H18Z" fill="url(#modepot-liquid)" />
                  <path class="flask-grid-line" d="M18 92h94M18 104h94M40 54v70M64 47v77M88 54v70" />
                  <circle class="flask-particle particle-one" cx="47" cy="92" r="1.8" />
                  <circle class="flask-particle particle-two" cx="70" cy="102" r="1.4" />
                  <circle class="flask-particle particle-three" cx="84" cy="88" r="1.1" />
                </g>
                <path class="flask-stream stream-one" d="M54 6c0 10 10 12 10 22" />
                <path class="flask-stream stream-two" d="M74 3c0 10-10 13-10 25" />
                <circle class="falling-particle particle-four" cx="54" cy="11" r="1.4" />
                <circle class="falling-particle particle-five" cx="74" cy="8" r="1.2" />
                <path class="brand-flask-outline" d="M44 22h10v20c0 5-2.3 9.6-6.2 12.4C34.1 64.3 26 78.2 26 93c0 17 12.7 25 38 25s38-8 38-25c0-14.8-8.1-28.7-21.8-38.6C76.3 51.6 74 47 74 42V22h10" />
                <path class="brand-flask-monogram" d="M42 100V80l22 16 22-16v20" />
              </svg>
              <div class="principle-grid"><span>MODERNIZE</span><span>SIMPLIFY</span><span>OPTIMIZE</span><span>INVENT</span></div>
              <p class="open-source-seal"><b>OPEN SOURCE</b><span>transparent · inspectable · extensible</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="output-zone">
              <p class="visual-heading"><span>MODERN SYSTEMS OUT</span><small>the flask transforms the foundations</small></p>
              <div class="concept-rack output-rack">
                <p><small>MODERN FOUNDATIONS</small><b>Frameworks + packages</b></p>
                <p><small>MEASURABLE PERFORMANCE</small><b>Optimized systems</b></p>
                <p><small>AI + AGENTS</small><b>Agent-friendly tools</b></p>
                <p><small>NEW FORMS</small><b>Engines + games</b></p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="visual-footnote" aria-hidden="true">REFORMULATE THE DEFAULTS</p>
          <figcaption id="modernization-visual-description" class="visually-hidden">The ModePot flask reformulates existing frameworks and packages, traditional software patterns, outdated runtime assumptions, accumulated complexity, fragmented interfaces, performance bottlenecks, human-only workflows, and difficult technical or creative challenges. Inside the transparent open-source vessel, four shared principles work together: modernize, simplify, optimize, and invent. The outcomes are modern frameworks and packages, optimized high-performance systems, AI-native and agent-friendly tools where valuable, innovative engines, and experimental games.</figcaption>
        </figure>

      </section>

      <section class="mode-selector" aria-labelledby="selector-title">
        <h2 id="selector-title" class="visually-hidden">Which ModePot project should you use?</h2>
        <p class="selector-label">If you need to…</p>
        <p class="selector-label">Use</p>
        {
          products.map((product) => (
            <a class={`selector-row selector-${product.accent} ph-no-autocapture`} href={`#${product.name}`}>
              <img class="selector-mark" src={product.mark} alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" />
              <span>{product.choice}</span>
              <strong>{product.name}</strong>
              <i aria-hidden="true">↓</i>
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </section>

      <div class="product-ledger" id="projects">
        {
          products.map((product) => (
            <article class={`product product-${product.accent}`} id={product.name}>
              <div class="product-index" aria-hidden="true">
                <span>{product.index}</span>
                <span>{product.mode}</span>
              </div>

              <figure class="product-art">
                <img src={product.image} alt={product.alt} loading="lazy" width="1200" height="900" />
                <figcaption>Mode {product.index} / {product.mode}</figcaption>
              </figure>

              <div class="product-copy">
                <div class="product-heading">
                  <img class="product-mark" src={product.mark} alt="" width="80" height="80" loading="lazy" />
                  <h2><span>{product.prefix}</span><strong>pot</strong></h2>
                </div>
                <p class="product-eyebrow">{product.category}</p>
                <p class="product-statement">{product.statement}</p>
                <p class="product-description">{product.description}</p>
                <section class={`demo-preview demo-${product.accent}`} aria-label={`${product.name} mechanism preview`}>
                  <p class="demo-caption">Illustrative animation · not a live run</p>
                  {product.name === 'dexpot' && (
                    <div class="mechanism dex-mechanism" aria-hidden="true">
                      <span class="mechanism-node">Request</span><span class="mechanism-arrow">→</span>
                      <span class="mechanism-node">Typed<br />validation</span><span class="mechanism-arrow">→</span>
                      <span class="mechanism-node">Response</span>
                    </div>
                  )}
                  {product.name === 'intpot' && (
                    <div class="mechanism int-mechanism" aria-hidden="true">
                      <span class="mechanism-node">One typed function</span>
                      <div class="mechanism-branches"><span>CLI</span><span>HTTP</span><span>MCP</span></div>
                    </div>
                  )}
                  {product.name === 'summonpot' && (
                    <div class="mechanism summon-mechanism" aria-hidden="true">
                      <span class="mechanism-node">Fixed request<br />values</span><span class="mechanism-arrow">→</span>
                      <span class="mechanism-node">Bounded agent<br />choice</span><span class="mechanism-arrow">→</span>
                      <span class="mechanism-node">Application<br />result</span>
                    </div>
                  )}
                  {product.name === 'lifepot' && (
                    <div class="mechanism life-mechanism" aria-hidden="true">
                      {lifeGenerations.map((cells, generation) => (
                        <div class="life-generation" data-generation={generation} aria-label={`Generation ${generation + 1}`}>
                          {[...cells.join('')].map((cell) => <i class={cell === '1' ? 'alive' : ''} />)}
                        </div>
                      ))}
                      <span class="life-caption">Birth · death · movement</span>
                    </div>
                  )}
                  <p class="visually-hidden">{product.name === 'lifepot' ? 'Illustrative Conway’s Game of Life: each frame follows the same neighbor-count birth and survival rules; live cells appear, disappear, and move.' : product.demoDescription}</p>
                  <a
                    class="demo-route ph-no-autocapture"
                    href={product.playground}
                    data-posthog-event="modepot_project_clicked"
                    data-posthog-project={product.name}
                    data-posthog-surface="modepot_homepage"
                  >{product.name === 'lifepot' ? 'Explore LifePot and choose a preset' : 'Open project playground'} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                </section>
                <div class="product-actions">
                  <a
                    class="product-link ph-no-autocapture"
                    href={product.href}
                    data-posthog-event="modepot_project_clicked"
                    data-posthog-project={product.name}
                    data-posthog-surface="modepot_homepage"
                  >
                    {product.action} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
                  </a>
                  <a
                    class="product-resource ph-no-autocapture"
                    href={product.docs}
                    data-posthog-event={product.name === 'lifepot' ? undefined : 'modepot_project_clicked'}
                    data-posthog-project={product.name === 'lifepot' ? undefined : product.name}
                    data-posthog-surface={product.name === 'lifepot' ? undefined : 'modepot_homepage'}
                  >Docs <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                  <a class="product-resource ph-no-autocapture" href={product.source.commitUrl}>Latest source commit · {product.source.commit.slice(0, 7)} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
